## 7. Risks & Unknowns

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| **Referencial Camões extraction harder than estimated** | High | Spike first: extract 5 nodes, measure time, decide go/no-go |
| **Abstract schema doesn’t accommodate grammar cross-linguistic differences** | High | Validate schema with 2–3 grammar points (ser/estar, tu/você) before full build |
| **Learners don’t return after first session** | Medium | Prototype review session with 3 users; measure friction points |
| **GitHub Pages limits (file size, build time)** | Low | Astro static output is well within limits; monitor as content grows |
| **Content authoring doesn’t scale beyond founder** | Medium | `CONTRIBUTING.md` + schema simplicity is the mitigation; validate with 1 contributor |

