## 8. Scope Boundaries

### In Scope (MVP)

- **EN→PT (European Portuguese)** language pair only
- **A1 level only** for content authoring
- **Abstract CEFR node model** with Zod schemas
- **SRS (SM-2) review interface** with localStorage persistence
- **CEFR Can-Do progress dashboard** for A1
- **Text-to-speech pronunciation** (Web Speech API, `pt-PT`)
- **GitHub Pages deployment** via Astro + GitHub Actions

### Explicitly Out of Scope

- User accounts / cloud sync (localStorage only for MVP)
- Mobile native app
- Content beyond A1
- Languages beyond EN↔PT
- Formal CEFR certification or assessment
- Synchronous tutoring or live sessions
- Social/community features beyond GitHub Discussions

